  "notes": "Removing material from a workpiece with a cutting tool to shape it. Covers turning, milling, drilling, and similar processes.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {切削|せっさく}{加工|かこう}: machining; cutting work\n- {切削|せっさく}{工具|こうぐ}: a cutting tool\n- {切削|せっさく}する: to machine; to cut\n\nRELATED:\n- {旋削|せんさく}: turning — cutting on a lathe, one type of {切削|せっさく}",
